{"seq":3,"slug":"transfer-kpi-warehouse-balance-metric","title":"调拨 KPI 与仓间平衡度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/interwarehouse-transfer-rebalance/transfer-optimization-ops/transfer-kpi-warehouse-balance-metric","wordCount":3108,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"调拨-kpi-与仓间平衡度量\">调拨 KPI 与仓间平衡度量</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-调拨-kpi-为什么不能照抄订单履约\">核心概念：调拨 KPI 为什么不能照抄订单履约</h2><p>调拨是<strong>内部再分配</strong>，它不增加供应总量，只搬动位置。这个性质决定了照抄客户订单的履约指标会立刻失真。订单履约的「完美订单率」（Perfect Order Fulfillment，ASCM/APICS SCOR 模型的核心指标）衡量的是「客户是否按时、按量、无差错收到货」；而一次仓间调拨没有客户，它的成败标准是「目的仓的服务水平是否被抬起来，且源仓没有被拖垮」。用订单视角评估调拨，会得到「调拨完成率 99%」这种漂亮数字，同时网络里两个仓都在报警。</p>\n<p>调拨 KPI 因此必须成对出现：<strong>收益侧</strong>（目的仓得到的改善）与<strong>代价侧</strong>（源仓与网络付出的成本）。任何只统计一侧的指标都会被博弈。制度层面也有先例——财政部 2006 年《企业会计准则第 1 号——存货》（财会〔2006〕3 号）要求存货按成本与可变现净值孰低计量，公司间调拨既不确认收入也不产生利润，只是成本在主体间转移；把它当作「销售」考核，就会诱导团队做无意义的来回调拨。</p>\n<p>一个可用的调拨 KPI 集合要能同时回答四个问题：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>需求被满足了多少</strong>——满足率，衡量调拨对目的仓缺口的治愈面。</li>\n<li><strong>满足得快不快</strong>——时效，衡量从承诺到下架的整个执行节奏。</li>\n<li><strong>平衡被改善了多少</strong>——失衡度量，衡量网络是否被推向均衡而非单纯搬运。</li>\n<li><strong>代价是否划算</strong>——成本与保护，衡量源仓与网络付出了多少。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下面的指标树把这四问拆成可采集的原子指标。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[调拨 KPI 树] --&gt; B[需求侧&lt;br/&gt;收益指标]&#10;    A --&gt; C[执行侧&lt;br/&gt;时效指标]&#10;    A --&gt; D[网络侧&lt;br/&gt;平衡指标]&#10;    A --&gt; E[代价侧&lt;br/&gt;成本与保护]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[调拨满足率&lt;br/&gt;fill rate]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[缺货回补率&lt;br/&gt;stockout recovery]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[调拨及时率&lt;br/&gt;on-time transfer]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[在途天数&lt;br/&gt;in-transit days]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[仓间失衡指数&lt;br/&gt;imbalance index]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[库存分布基尼系数]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[调拨成本占货值比]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[源仓服务水平保护率]&#10;    B1 --&gt; F[复核: 是否被博弈]&#10;    C2 --&gt; F&#10;    D1 --&gt; F&#10;    E2 --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[调拨作业复盘&lt;br/&gt;每周/每月]\">flowchart TD\n    A[调拨 KPI 树] --&gt; B[需求侧&lt;br/&gt;收益指标]\n    A --&gt; C[执行侧&lt;br/&gt;时效指标]\n    A --&gt; D[网络侧&lt;br/&gt;平衡指标]\n    A --&gt; E[代价侧&lt;br/&gt;成本与保护]\n    B --&gt; B1[调拨满足率&lt;br/&gt;fill rate]\n    B --&gt; B2[缺货回补率&lt;br/&gt;stockout recovery]\n    C --&gt; C1[调拨及时率&lt;br/&gt;on-time transfer]\n    C --&gt; C2[在途天数&lt;br/&gt;in-transit days]\n    D --&gt; D1[仓间失衡指数&lt;br/&gt;imbalance index]\n    D --&gt; D2[库存分布基尼系数]\n    E --&gt; E1[调拨成本占货值比]\n    E --&gt; E2[源仓服务水平保护率]\n    B1 --&gt; F[复核: 是否被博弈]\n    C2 --&gt; F\n    D1 --&gt; F\n    E2 --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[调拨作业复盘&lt;br/&gt;每周/每月]</pre><h2 id=\"需求侧-调拨满足率与缺货回补率\">需求侧：调拨满足率与缺货回补率</h2><p><strong>调拨满足率</strong>（transfer fill rate）是调拨场景下最重要、也最容易被算错的一个数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>TransferFillRate</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{TransferFillRate} = \\frac{\\sum_i \\min(q^{demand}_i,\\ q^{fulfilled}_i)}{\\sum_i q^{demand}_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TransferFillRate</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.6773em;vertical-align:-1.0206em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6567em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2791em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8309em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">man</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">man</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.967em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0206em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>分子用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min(\\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 而非直接累加已发数量，是为了防止「超发掩盖欠发」——当某个 SKU 超量调拨、另一个 SKU 完全没满足时，直接求和会得到虚高的满足率。分母是<strong>净需求</strong>（net requirement），也就是目的仓缺口扣掉在途与安全库存之后的量，其计算口径在 <a href=\"../transfer-requirement-strategy/transfer-demand-sources-net-requirement\">调拨需求来源与净需求计算模型</a> 中定义。满足率若用毛需求做分母，会系统性低估，因为毛需求里含了大量本不该由调拨满足的量。</p>\n<p><strong>缺货回补率</strong>衡量调拨对目的仓断货的治愈能力：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>RecoveryRate</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>因调拨而终止的断货事件数</mtext><mtext>调拨到达前发生的断货事件总数</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RecoveryRate} = \\frac{\\text{因调拨而终止的断货事件数}}{\\text{调拨到达前发生的断货事件总数}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RecoveryRate</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">调拨到达前发生的断货事件总数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">因调拨而终止的断货事件数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>它与满足率的差别在于时间维度：满足率看「这批单满足了几成」，回补率看「断货这件事有没有被调拨真正终结」。两者都要看，因为可以高满足率、低回补率——货到了但到得太晚，断货已经发生并已由采购补上，这次调拨的收益是零。</p>\n<p><strong>调拨需求积压（backlog）</strong> 应作为满足率的分母质量检查项单列：积压持续增长的仓说明它的缺口不是靠调拨能解决的，需要回到采购或开新仓的决策层。把这类仓的调拨请求一直挂在队列里，会让满足率因为分母膨胀而「看起来正常」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>公式要点</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>典型健康区间</th>\n<th>常见造假手法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>调拨满足率</td>\n<td>Σmin(需求, 满足)/Σ需求</td>\n<td>调拨单 + 净需求快照</td>\n<td>70%–90%</td>\n<td>用毛需求做分母、超发掩盖欠发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缺货回补率</td>\n<td>被终结断货数/断货总数</td>\n<td>断货事件日志</td>\n<td>55%–80%</td>\n<td>只统计「正在断货时下的调拨单」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需求积压量</td>\n<td>未满足累加量</td>\n<td>请求队列</td>\n<td>逐周下降</td>\n<td>把积压请求标记为「取消」冲销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首次调拨命中率</td>\n<td>一次调拨即满足的比例</td>\n<td>调拨单序列</td>\n<td>60%–85%</td>\n<td>拆单后只看第一单</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"执行侧-及时率与在途天数\">执行侧：及时率与在途天数</h2><p><strong>调拨及时率</strong>的分母是「承诺到达日」，不是「下单日 + 平均前置期」。跨境调拨的前置期方差极大——海运整柜与空运、保税仓间卡车与跨关区调拨，前置期差一到两个数量级。用平均值做承诺会奖励那些只做短途调拨的仓。正确做法是每个调拨任务带一个<strong>承诺到达窗口</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[t_a, t_b]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>OnTimeRate</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext>实际到达</mtext><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>b</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext>已完成的调拨任务</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{OnTimeRate} = \\frac{\\#\\{ \\text{实际到达} \\in [t_a, t_b] \\}}{\\#\\{\\text{已完成的调拨任务}\\}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">OnTimeRate</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">#</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">已完成的调拨任务</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">#</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">实际到达</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]}</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>在途天数</strong>是在途库存（in-transit inventory）的资金占用度量。用利特尔法则（Little&#39;s Law, J.D.C. Little, 1961）可以把它和调拨量联系起来：在途库存 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{transit} = \\lambda \\times W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 是调拨到达速率、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 是平均在途时长。缩短 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 是降低在途占用的唯一非增量手段——把整柜拆成多个小批只会抬高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>，总额不变。在途库存的账务归属（发出仓还是目的仓持有）直接影响这个指标由谁扛，其口径详见 <a href=\"../intransit-accounting-bonded/transfer-cost-allocation-intransit-accounting\">调拨成本分摊与在途账务</a>。</p>\n<p>一个必须警惕的执行侧陷阱是<strong>拆批伪造</strong>：把一个大批次的调拨拆成多条小单，只要有一条按时到达，就把它算作「及时」。防护方法是在分母里按<strong>调拨任务</strong>（一个目的仓 + 一个 SKU 组 + 一个承诺窗口）计数，而不是按单据行计数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"网络侧-仓间失衡度量\">网络侧：仓间失衡度量</h2><p>这是整套指标里最容易被忽略、却最能暴露结构问题的一层。<strong>仓间平衡</strong>不是「每个仓库存差不多」，而是「每个仓的库存相对其需求是匹配的」。</p>\n<p><strong>仓间失衡指数</strong>（imbalance index）用库存覆盖天数（Days of Supply, DOS）在仓间的离散度衡量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Imbalance</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>DOS</mtext><mi>w</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>DOS</mtext><mi>w</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mtext>CV</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>DOS</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Imbalance} = \\frac{\\sigma(\\text{DOS}_w)}{\\mu(\\text{DOS}_w)} = \\text{CV}(\\text{DOS})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Imbalance</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DOS</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DOS</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CV</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DOS</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>DOS</mtext><mi>w</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mtext>仓 </mtext><mi>w</mi><mtext> 的可用库存</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>仓 </mtext><mi>w</mi><mtext> 的日均需求</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{DOS}_w = \\dfrac{\\text{仓 } w \\text{ 的可用库存}}{\\text{仓 } w \\text{ 的日均需求}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DOS</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">仓</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">的日均需求</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">仓</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">的可用库存</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。用变异系数（CV）而非标准差，是因为各仓需求规模差异巨大，绝对值不可比。失衡指数下降说明调拨在把网络推向均衡；若调拨量上升而失衡指数不降，说明调拨在<strong>搬运失衡而非消除失衡</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>库存分布基尼系数</strong>补充度量集中度。把各仓库存占比按升序排列，基尼系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 越接近 0 越均衡、越接近 1 越集中：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mi>i</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G = \\frac{2\\sum_{i=1}^{n} i \\cdot x_i}{n\\sum_{i=1}^{n} x_i} - \\frac{n+1}{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.488em;vertical-align:-0.994em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.494em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3057em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.994em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>基尼系数适合向管理层展示「货是不是堆在少数几个仓」，但它对需求差异不敏感，所以要和失衡指数一起看。<strong>只看基尼系数会诱导「把货均匀摊开」</strong>，而均匀摊开对需求差异大的网络是灾难。</p>\n<p><strong>网络服务水平</strong>（network service level）是这层的目的变量：全部仓的加权现货满足率。一次成功的调拨应当让網絡服务水平上升且失衡指数下降；若只有前者上升，通常是牺牲了源仓，需要用下一节的保护率来交叉验证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代价侧-调拨成本与源仓保护\">代价侧：调拨成本与源仓保护</h2><p><strong>调拨成本占货值比</strong>把调拨的运输、关务、装卸、保险、在途资金成本加总，除以调拨货值。跨境调拨里这笔成本常常不便宜：一段跨太平洋海运加上清关与两端国内段，可达货值的 8%–15%。<strong>当某条调拨线路的成本比超过目的仓断货的缺货成本期望值时，这条调拨就是不划算的</strong>，系统应当在计划阶段就拦住它，而不是执行完再复盘。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CostRatio</mtext><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>运费</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>关税</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>装卸</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>保险</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>在途资金成本</mtext></mrow><mtext>调拨货值</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CostRatio}_{w\\to d} = \\frac{\\text{运费} + \\text{关税} + \\text{装卸} + \\text{保险} + \\text{在途资金成本}}{\\text{调拨货值}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CostRatio</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">→</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">调拨货值</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">运费</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">关税</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">装卸</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">保险</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">在途资金成本</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>源仓服务水平保护率</strong>是防止「越调越缺」的守门指标。定义调拨后源仓的库存位置与保护线（safety stock 或最小展示量）的关系：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ProtectionRate</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext>调拨后源仓库存低于保护线的调拨单</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext>调拨单总数</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ProtectionRate} = 1 - \\frac{\\#\\{\\text{调拨后源仓库存低于保护线的调拨单}\\}}{\\#\\{\\text{调拨单总数}\\}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ProtectionRate</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">#</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">调拨单总数</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">#</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">调拨后源仓库存低于保护线的调拨单</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个指标低于 0.9 就说明补货引擎在用源仓的断货换取目的仓的满足，长期必然引发反向调拨。是否允许击穿保护线、由哪个角色审批，属于策略治理范围，其配置与覆盖机制见 <a href=\"../transfer-requirement-strategy/transfer-policy-config-override-governance\">调拨策略配置与覆盖治理</a>。</p>\n<p>代价侧还有一个直接的舞弊信号：<strong>越库再调拨率</strong>——同一 SKU 在一个调拨周期内被调出去又调回来。它本应接近零。非零且持续上升，说明需求预测或仓间参数配置有结构性问题，调拨系统在替一个坏计划做无用功。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复盘节奏与博弈防护\">复盘节奏与博弈防护</h2><p>指标要有采集节奏和复核机制，否则会被逐层优化掉。一个可操作的节奏是：<strong>日</strong>看执行侧（及时率、在途异常），<strong>周</strong>看需求侧与代价侧（满足率、保护率、越库再调拨），<strong>月</strong>看网络侧（失衡指数、基尼系数、成本占比）。月度复盘必须把四层指标放在一张表上一起看，单独看任何一层都会被博弈。</p>\n<p>博弈防护的核心原则是<strong>指标对偶</strong>：每个收益指标都配一个代价指标，任一被单独解读都不成立。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>收益指标</th>\n<th>对偶代价指标</th>\n<th>单独看会怎样被博弈</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>调拨满足率</td>\n<td>源仓保护率</td>\n<td>抽干源仓把目的仓灌满</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调拨及时率</td>\n<td>在途天数 / 成本占比</td>\n<td>只做短途、空运堆时效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>失衡指数下降</td>\n<td>调拨量 / 越库再调拨率</td>\n<td>反复搬运制造「均衡」假象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络服务水平</td>\n<td>调拨成本占货值比</td>\n<td>用昂贵调拨买服务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一条纪律：<strong>调拨 KPI 不进个人绩效的单一权重</strong>。调拨是网络级决策，把它压到某个仓的 KPI 上，那个仓的最优解就是隐藏自己的盈余、夸大自己的缺口。一个更稳的做法是把指标挂在<strong>补货/调拨计划职能</strong>上，由它同时为满足率与失衡指数负责，让两个目标在同一个主体内部互相制衡。这样，指标才是在描述网络，而不是在描述某个仓的报表。</p>\n<h2 id=\"把指标接回执行\">把指标接回执行</h2><p>调拨 KPI 的采集点全部来自调拨单与执行事件——下单、拣货、发运、到达、上架。这意味着指标系统的前提是调拨单本身有干净的状态机，每一次状态跃迁都带时间戳与操作人。状态模型若有歧义（例如「已发运」与「已离仓」不分），及时率与在途天数就永远算不准。调拨单的状态与跃迁规则见 <a href=\"../transfer-order-execution/transfer-order-model-state-machine\">调拨单模型与状态机</a>，具体的拣货—发运—收货事件流见 <a href=\"../transfer-order-execution/transfer-execution-pick-pack-ship-receive\">调拨执行：拣货、包装、发运与收货</a>。指标层不做业务判断，它只忠实聚合这两个来源；一旦发现某个指标长期失真，第一件事是回去查事件流的定义，而不是改指标的公式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>调拨 KPI 的全部难点在于它是<strong>网络级指标</strong>：任何单侧指标都会被逐层优化掉。可操作的做法只有三条。第一，成对设计——每个收益指标（满足率、及时率、失衡下降）都配一个代价指标（源仓保护率、在途天数、成本占比），单独解读任一个都不成立。第二，自包含采集——所有指标都从调拨单状态机与执行事件流派生，不依赖某个仓的人手上报，状态机定义不清就先把状态机改干净。第三，节奏分层——日看执行、周看需求与代价、月看网络，月度复盘必须把四层放进同一张表。当调拨量上升而失衡指数不降、或越库再调拨率持续非零时，问题不在指标公式，而在需求预测或仓间参数配置——此时该修的是计划，不是仪表盘。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"调拨 KPI 与仓间平衡度量","id":"调拨-kpi-与仓间平衡度量"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：调拨 KPI 为什么不能照抄订单履约","id":"核心概念-调拨-kpi-为什么不能照抄订单履约"},{"level":2,"text":"需求侧：调拨满足率与缺货回补率","id":"需求侧-调拨满足率与缺货回补率"},{"level":2,"text":"执行侧：及时率与在途天数","id":"执行侧-及时率与在途天数"},{"level":2,"text":"网络侧：仓间失衡度量","id":"网络侧-仓间失衡度量"},{"level":2,"text":"代价侧：调拨成本与源仓保护","id":"代价侧-调拨成本与源仓保护"},{"level":2,"text":"复盘节奏与博弈防护","id":"复盘节奏与博弈防护"},{"level":2,"text":"把指标接回执行","id":"把指标接回执行"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"调拨网络平衡与成本优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/interwarehouse-transfer-rebalance/transfer-optimization-ops/transfer-network-balancing-cost-optimization"},"next":null}